{"name":"Havana Coffee","hex":"#554941","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"coffee","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A beverage made by infusing the beans of the coffee plant in hot water. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A serving of this beverage."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a pale brown colour, like that of milk coffee.","Of a table: a small, low table suitable for people in lounge seating to put coffee cups on."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/coffee"}],"entries":[{"title":"Havana","blocks":[{"text":"Havana is the capital and largest city of Cuba. The heart of La Habana Province, Havana is the country's main port and commercial center. It is the most populous city, the largest by area, and the second-largest metropolitan area in the Caribbean region. The population in 2021 was 2,142,939 inhabitants, and its area is 728.26 km2 (281.18 sq mi) for the capital city and 8,475.57 km2 for the metropolitan zone. Its official population however had dropped to 1,749,964 inhabitants by the end of 2024."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/DJI_0197_crp_wiki.jpg/330px-DJI_0197_crp_wiki.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Havana","wikidata":"Q1563"},{"title":"Coffee","blocks":[{"text":"Coffee is a beverage brewed from roasted, ground coffee beans. Dark-colored and bitter, coffee has a stimulating effect on humans due to its caffeine content; however decaffeinated coffee is also commercially available. There are also various coffee substitutes."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Latte_and_dark_coffee.jpg/330px-Latte_and_dark_coffee.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee","wikidata":"Q8486"},{"title":"Coffee (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Coffee is a brownish color that is a representation of a roasted coffee bean. Different types of coffee beans have different colors when roasted—the color coffee represents an average."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Roasted_coffee_beans.jpg/330px-Roasted_coffee_beans.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_(color)","wikidata":"Q2932937"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg/500px-El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg/1280px-El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg/500px-El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEl_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg/500px-Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg/1280px-Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg/500px-Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACastillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_(Jan_2014).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/L%C3%ADnea%2C_La_Habana%2C_C